<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Quicken</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 14), Conjurer (guild level 15), Thief (guild level 35), Assassin (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast quicken &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast quicken</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Makes the target a little faster, so they strike more often in a fight. The 
better your creation sphere, the longer it lasts: from half a minute to almost 
two minutes.
</p><p>Quicken, haste and slow replace each other: only the last one cast on someone 
holds. Haste speeds them up twice as much as quicken, and slow slows them down 
as much as haste speeds them up, so quicken is also a way to lift a slow. You 
must be standing. It is also found on potions, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Haste</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Slow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>